@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction
title Civ13 conceptual component architecture (source pinned)
actor "Player / administrator" as U
component "BYOND client\nverbs, Click, Topic, HUD" as C
component "BYOND runtime\nworld / native callbacks" as E
component "Global initialization\nworld.New / startup hooks" as B
component "Legacy processScheduler\n+ game controller" as S
component "Ticker / map_metadata\njobs / factions" as R
component "Mob Life / objects\nweather / chemistry / vehicles" as G
component "Lighting sources\nshared corners / overlays" as L
component "1713 content\ncrafting / research / turfs" as D
component "Persistence\nowned save/load + recovery" as P
database "Per-z saves\ndurable graph / markers" as F
component "NanoUI / stat panels\nbrowser assets" as N
component "File spools / world Topic\nwebhooks" as I
component "Separate bot / Help worker\ndeployment supervisor" as X
U --> C
C --> E
E --> B
B --> S
S --> R
S --> G
S --> L
C --> G : input dispatch
G --> D
R --> P
G --> P
P --> F
S --> N
N --> C
E --> I
I --> X
note bottom of S
MC / timer infrastructure is also included.
Inclusion alone does not prove active startup reachability.
end note
@enduml
